# 仓库内统一用 LF；.bat 必须是 CRLF，否则老版本 cmd 可能出错
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.tsv text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.pkl binary
adclean/data/locate_*.txt binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
